DocumentDrivenDX pgserver fork
Based on https://github.com/orm011/pgserver (Apache-2.0).
Original author: Oscar Moll. See LICENSE and upstream Git history.
Changes: PostgreSQL 16.15/17.11/18.6, pgvector 0.8.6, verified source downloads, portable
pgvector compilation, relocatable native libraries, bundled dependency licenses, and release wheel automation.
